    },
    {
      "body": "@robertgshaw2-redhat  This appears to address the missing dependency behind the startup failure I reported in [#62677](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/62677).\r\n\r\nWith the official vllm/vllm-openai:v0.32.0 image, GLM-5.3 on two nodes with 8× B300 each (TP=8, DP=2, EP=16) fails with:\r\n\r\nFailed to get RDMA connection speed: [Errno 2] No such file or directory: 'ibstat'\r\nZeroDivisionError: float division by zero\r\n\r\nThe exception occurs in DeepEP’s get_theoretical_num_sms() after checkpoint loading and prevents the server from starting. It repeated across two startup attempts.\r\n\r\nCould you or the reviewers clarify what remains before this can be merged? This is blocking our multi-node deepep_v2 deployment, and getting the dependency into an upcoming official image would help.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-21T09:11:53Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/56878#issuecomment-6312352436",
      "id": 6312352436,
      "updated_at": "2026-10-21T09:11:53Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "devopsInterviews"
      }
    }
